@startuml
title SensibLaw reviewed LegalFollow max-cut

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Primary-law acquisition" {
  [LegalFollow residual] as residual
  [Typed source demand] as demand
  [Governed OALC] as oalc
  [Pinned source receipt] as source
}

package "Reviewed admission" {
  [Authority identity review] as identity
  [Proposition review and payment] as proposition
  [Citation-use treatment review] as treatment
}

package "Canonical legal world" {
  [Reviewed candidate delta] as delta
  [Typed trace and provenance] as trace
  [Residual recomputation] as recompute
  [Consumer adequacy check] as adequacy
}

package "Read-only consumers" {
  [MatterRuntime] as runtime
  [Projection / VisualisationIR] as projection
}

residual --> demand
demand --> oalc
oalc --> source
source --> identity : review gate
identity --> proposition : exact identity retained
identity --> treatment : exact identity retained
proposition --> delta : reviewed support only
treatment --> delta : reviewed citation use only
delta --> trace : append provenance
trace --> recompute
recompute --> residual : fresh selectable work
trace --> adequacy
trace --> runtime
runtime --> projection

note right of oalc
Acquisition substrate only.
Zero result is not negative legal evidence.
end note

note right of identity
Raw OALC identity cannot create
a canonical legal authority alias.
QID is supplemental scheduling metadata.
end note

note right of delta
Candidate only.
No legal authority.
No current-law conclusion.
Corroborating review units may
deduplicate to one semantic hop.
All review provenance remains.
end note

note right of recompute
Paid work cannot resurrect itself.
No selectable residual means only
that the current frontier is closed.
end note

note right of adequacy
Runtime coverage is not FactorsThrough.
Formal adequacy needs an actual
query-indexed proof witness.
end note

note bottom
ZKP frame
O: close source-to-reviewed-hop-to-frontier handoff.
R: reuse existing OALC, review, residual, Pareto, snowball and adequacy owners.
C: enforce explicit identity, proposition and treatment gates.
S: fail closed on unresolved, contested, context-only and unsupported inputs.
L: one disjoint legal reviewed-hop lane.
P: exact source revision, reviewer evidence and declared consumer coordinates.
G: preserve source, DASHI, Ibrahim and meta-introspector attribution. ESD is read-only.
F: emit candidate deltas and residuals only.

Process lenses: ITIL; ISO 9000; ISO/IEC 42001, 27001, 27701, 23894, 9241;
NIST AI RMF; Six Sigma; C4. These govern process and traceability only.
end note
@enduml
